        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bfd2312c-c1c6-55b9-8292-279400ac77c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Naga Chaitanya, Tamannaah, Kishore Kumar Pardasani, Vasu Varma, Dil Raju\n- Films: Tadakha, Konchem Ishtam Konchem Kashtam, 100% Love, Josh\n- Topics: Telugu cinema\n\nFacts:\n- Akkineni Naga Chaitanya was born on 23 November 1986 and is an Indian film actor who works in Telugu cinema.\n- Naga Chaitanya debuted in the 2009 film \"Josh,\" which was directed by newcomer Vasu Varma and produced by Dil Raju.\n- \"Tadakha,\" also spelt as \"Thadaka\" and translated in English as \"Mettle,\" is a 2013 Telugu action film directed by Kishore Kumar Pardasani.\n- Kishore Kumar Pardasani had earlier directed the film \"Konchem Ishtam Konchem Kashtam.\"\n- In \"Tadakha,\" Tamannaah appears opposite Naga Chaitanya for the second time after \"100% Love.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
